re will also  make her way back from volantis as well  so who really knows maybe he comes back  for one last scene since so many people  are going to be traveling by  Oh someone might actually run into him  but if anyone is gonna find him it's  most likely gonna be Davos maybe after  all the fighting is over Davos decides  to get the hell out of Westeros for a  while and he can hitch a ride with his  old pal  but as you can see there are still a lot  of unresolved storylines that have been  left open over the years and with  everyone moving around in this final  season I think there is still a chance  we may see some of them again especially  after the wars are over  in the final episode we should see  everyone who has survived come together  in some way to try and rebuild and  restore some sort of normalcy if any way  possible I'm not gonna row anything out  just yet but I guess we're just gonna  have to wait and see from this list  which character or characters do you  think is most likely to make a return  before it's all said and done put your  answer down in the comments let's see  who can guess it right I want to thank  you all for watching the video I  appreciate that as always and I also  want to thank all of you kind people  that support this channel on patreon I  hope everybody has a great day I'll see  you in the next one bye  [Music]  you

